  "title": "Fix SAMR LookNames(opnum: 17) parsing failure.",
  "description": "Fix SAMR LookNames(opnum: 17) parsing failure.\n\nWithout fix:\n\n```\n   59 2024-01-21 09:48:08   127.0.0.1 → 127.0.0.1   SAMR LookupNames request[Long frame (80 bytes)]\n   60 2024-01-21 09:48:08   127.0.0.1 → 127.0.0.1   SAMR LookupNames response\n```\n\nWith fix: \n\n```\n 59 2024-01-21 09:48:08 127.0.0.1 → 127.0.0.1 SAMR LookupNames request\n 60 2024-01-21 09:48:08 127.0.0.1 → 127.0.0.1 SAMR LookupNames response\n```\n\nSorry i cannot share the pcap.",
